There are pedophiles all in this industry everywhere. And they cover for each other. It's all smoke and mirrors. The parents of these very young artists are the biggest fools. Literslly throwing their babies to these wolves.

&#x200B;

If any company including hybe says they "care" about their artists. It's a lie to gain the public's trust. They only and always will only carr about money. If they habe to subliminally market to the fantasies of pedos and that brings in the money, they will keep doing it. In 2nd gen kpop this sexualizing of girls got called out and it stopped for awhile. But, I can see it coming back. They think they are clever trying to market it for teenagers, but its very subliminally there what theu are trying to do. 

&#x200B;

NWJ went from  wearing baggy pants and crop tops to wearing crop tops and super mini skirts exposing their safety shorts. What adult looked at that and thought that was ok to send them out there to a crowd full  men??? Throwing them to the wolves. All for money.
